# a72: MIDI clock at 120 BPM as Bluetooth MIDI gives it: the ticks of one 15 ms connection event come together.
# Start with the first tick, Stop and Start in one event, Stop, then the link ends: the tempo stays 120.
wait 300
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
midi FA 00 00
midi F8 00 00
wait 15
midi F8 00 00
wait 15
expect playing 1
